  {
   "id": "a16-note",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1535,
   "width": 570,
   "height": 70,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A16 无前置：正常结束、异常、取消、通信结束均安全收尾；A11 校相未收敛时禁止 A13/A14。\nA12 按参数同时准备可选 Z 已知可控噪声；A14 期间 Z 噪声持续注入，配对只切换 AM 噪声输出。",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "A16 无前置：正常结束、异常、取消、通信结束均安全收尾；A11 校相未收敛时禁止 A13/A14。\nA12 按参数同时准备可选 Z 已知可控噪声；A14 期间 Z 噪声持续注入，配对只切换 AM 噪声输出。",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "analysis-note",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 830,
   "y": 395,
   "width": 570,
   "height": 70,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "移动峰自动标定不足时按运行参数 K/B 生成暂定控制轴，\n结果保留但标记质量未通过；不可控背景 N_S1 与受控响应 S_beta 独立验收，\n差谱只使用对应两态共同有效点，结果为锁相测量端 PSD。",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "移动峰自动标定不足时按运行参数 K/B 生成暂定控制轴，\n结果保留但标记质量未通过；不可控背景 N_S1 与受控响应 S_beta 独立验收，\n差谱只使用对应两态共同有效点，结果为锁相测量端 PSD。",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  }
